      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} my headset is a pc headset known as DPVR E4, its a camera tracked headset, it just uses normal steam vr\n\nit don't use hand tracking at all, but vrchat has forced hand tracking mode on, so i had a hard time signing in,\n\nafter finally signing in, i had to make this post, i eventually found a option that made it so i didn't have to use desktop view to awkwardly click, but clicker movers every time i click because its trying to follow a finger bone, \n\nafter posting this bug report i went to a friend's world and discovered i can't hold any items i grab thus making most game worlds completely unplayable,",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
