      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "vrchat update made it so i can hold things i grab again, so games are finally playable again,\n\nbut now the radial menu is not available to me at all\n\nand i have mixed feelings about having to look at my wrist to open my vrchat menu\n\nso overall being forced into a mode my headset was not made for is still frustrating,\n\n it severely needs a serious in game off switch",
