  "details": "i had extremely annoying time signing in, i had to us steam's desktop view and awkwardly aim my controllers to not click on anything that wasn't vrchat because mouse and vrchat pointer don't line up,\n\nwhen i finally got in game i found out the game is trying to make me use hand tracking, witch my headset is not capable of, so i had to awkwardly aim again to turn of exclusive mode\n\ni cant find a off switch for hand tracking itself,  THERE SERIOUSLY NEEDS TO BE A OFF SWITCH, so if there is a off switch please make it easier to find\n\nAND DONT MAKE IT A DEFAULT ON FEATURE, because people like me are gonna have a hard time signing in to your game, and most will probably think your game is broken and give up before even realizing the can try the desktop view, \n\ni don't have quest i don't want quest,\n\nwhat i want is a off switch for hand tracking because i don't have hand tracking but vrchat is acting like i do, and is making vrchat slightly un playable,  and makes the menu easy to miss click",
